import Foundation

/// Builds the error for one error schema an operation declares. An operation
/// hands the factories of its own declared error responses to
/// ``ApiError/fromResponse(statusCode:headers:body:requestMethod:requestPath:errorSchemas:)``,
/// which picks the one for the status that arrived.
///
/// The arguments are the status code, the response headers, the raw response
/// body and the method and path of the request.
public typealias ErrorFactory = (Int, [String: String]?, String, String?, String?) -> ApiError
